Zayn's MiniMind-V

This project contains adapted code and tokenizer assets from:
- MiniMind by jingyaogong and contributors:
  https://github.com/jingyaogong/minimind
- MiniMind-V by jingyaogong and contributors:
  https://github.com/jingyaogong/minimind-v
  Source snapshot: 1862b633fc082a723e78dbead9777545f09d960c

The upstream projects are licensed under Apache-2.0; see LICENSE.
Modifications in 2026 include a consolidated training pipeline, a wider
vision projector, validated image spans, vectorized feature insertion,
English documentation, and self-contained exports with frozen vision weights.
The original tokenizer vocabulary and token IDs are retained for checkpoint
compatibility. Pretrained vision weights are downloaded separately and are
not distributed in this repository.
